{"id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#cor:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-estimate","title":"cor:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-estimate","path":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI.md","line":547,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI.tex#cor:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-estimate","uses":["[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#prop:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-principle]]","[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#lem:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-le]]","[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#rem:pet-ch6-riccati-liminf-hypothesis]]","[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#rem:pet-ch6-riccati-estimate-strictness]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI.tex","label":"cor:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-estimate","line":1250,"source":"\\begin{corollary}[Riccati comparison estimate]\n  \\label{cor:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-estimate}\n\n  \\source{petersen:page-0270,petersen:page-0271}\n  \\uses{prop:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-principle, lem:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-le, rem:pet-ch6-riccati-liminf-hypothesis, rem:pet-ch6-riccati-estimate-strictness}\n\n  \\dcref{ch6:6.4.2a}\n  Let $\\rho:(0,b)\\to\\mathbb{R}$ be smooth with $\\rho(t)=\\tfrac1t+O(t)$ and $k\\in\\mathbb{R}$.\n  (1) If $\\dot\\rho+\\rho^2\\le-k$, then $\\rho(t)\\le\\operatorname{sn}_k'(t)/\\operatorname{sn}_k(t)$, and\n  moreover $b\\le\\pi/\\sqrt k$ when $k>0$. (2) If $-k\\le\\dot\\rho+\\rho^2$, then\n  $\\operatorname{sn}_k'(t)/\\operatorname{sn}_k(t)\\le\\rho(t)$ for all $t<b$ when $k\\le0$, and for\n  $t<\\min\\{b,\\pi/\\sqrt k\\}$ when $k>0$.\n\n  The endpoint is non-strict; see\n  \\cref{rem:pet-ch6-riccati-estimate-strictness}.\n\\end{corollary}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Corollary</div></section>[Riccati comparison estimate] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-636f723a7065742d6368362d726963636174692d636f6d70617269736f6e2d657374696d617465\"></span> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source\" style=\"display:block\">Source: <span class=\"reference\">petersen:page-0270, petersen:page-0271</span></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI%23prop%3Apet-ch6-riccati-comparison-principle\">↗ prop:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-principle</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI%23lem%3Apet-ch6-riccati-comparison-le\">↗ lem:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-le</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI%23rem%3Apet-ch6-riccati-liminf-hypothesis\">↗ rem:pet-ch6-riccati-liminf-hypothesis</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI%23rem%3Apet-ch6-riccati-estimate-strictness\">↗ rem:pet-ch6-riccati-estimate-strictness</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch6:6.4.2a</span></span>Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\rho :(0,b)\\to \\mathbb {R}$\">$\\rho :(0,b)\\to \\mathbb {R}$</span> be smooth with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\rho (t)=\\tfrac 1t+O(t)$\">$\\rho (t)=\\tfrac 1t+O(t)$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$k\\in \\mathbb {R}$\">$k\\in \\mathbb {R}$</span>. (1) If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\dot\\rho +\\rho ^2\\le -k$\">$\\dot\\rho +\\rho ^2\\le -k$</span>, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\rho (t)\\le \\operatorname {sn}_k&#x27;(t)/\\operatorname {sn}_k(t)$\">$\\rho (t)\\le \\operatorname {sn}_k&#x27;(t)/\\operatorname {sn}_k(t)$</span>, and moreover <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$b\\le \\pi /\\sqrt k$\">$b\\le \\pi /\\sqrt k$</span> when <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$k&gt;0$\">$k&gt;0$</span>. (2) If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$-k\\le \\dot\\rho +\\rho ^2$\">$-k\\le \\dot\\rho +\\rho ^2$</span>, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\operatorname {sn}_k&#x27;(t)/\\operatorname {sn}_k(t)\\le \\rho (t)$\">$\\operatorname {sn}_k&#x27;(t)/\\operatorname {sn}_k(t)\\le \\rho (t)$</span> for all <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$t&lt;b$\">$t&lt;b$</span> when <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$k\\le 0$\">$k\\le 0$</span>, and for <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$t&lt;\\min \\{ b,\\pi /\\sqrt k\\} $\">$t&lt;\\min \\{ b,\\pi /\\sqrt k\\} $</span> when <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$k&gt;0$\">$k&gt;0$</span>. <p></p>The endpoint is non-strict; see <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI%23rem%3Apet-ch6-riccati-estimate-strictness\" data-tex-node=\"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#rem:pet-ch6-riccati-estimate-strictness\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-72656d3a7065742d6368362d726963636174692d657374696d6174652d7374726963746e657373\">section 4</a>. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#rem:pet-ch6-riccati-liminf-hypothesis","next":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#rem:pet-ch6-riccati-estima