\\sqrt k$ when $k>0$. (2) If $-k\\le\\dot\\rho+\\rho^2$, then\n  $\\operatorname{sn}_k'(t)/\\operatorname{sn}_k(t)\\le\\rho(t)$ for all $t<b$ when $k\\le0$, and for\n  $t<\\min\\{b,\\pi/\\sqrt k\\}$ when $k>0$.\n\n  The endpoint is non-strict; see\n  \\cref{rem:pet-ch6-riccati-estimate-strictness}.\n\\end{corollary}","source":"tex/references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#prop:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-principle","title":"prop:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-principle","description":""},{"node":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#lem:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-le","title":"lem:pet-ch6-riccati-comparison-le","description":""},{"node":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#rem:pet-ch6-riccati-liminf-hypothesis","title":"rem:pet-ch6-riccati-liminf-hypothesis","description":""},{"node":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_SectionalCurvatureComparisonI#rem:pet-ch6-riccati-estimate-strictness","title":"rem:pet-ch6-riccati-estimate-strictness","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}